{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14373","headline":"空灵岸 · 张叔卿","name":"空灵岸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒尽鸿先去，江回客未归。\n早知名是幻，不敢绣爲衣。\n雾积川原暗，山多郡县稀。\n今朝下湘岸，更逐鹧鸪飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张叔卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}